<title>USA: TABLE - Cinergy Q2 shr flat.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Cinergy Q2 shr flat.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 0.35	   $	 0.35</p>
<p> Net			 55,489		   56,040</p>
<p> Revs		     865,333		  716,834</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 157,697		  157,697</p>
<p>12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 2.14	   $	 2.23</p>
<p> Net			338,222		  351,727</p>
<p> Revs		   3,537,424		3,150,584</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 157,697		  157,448</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: For the 12 months ended June 30 net income applicable to common stock was $319.831 million, after costs of reacquisition of preferred stock of subsidiary of $18.391 million. Net income per share applicable to common stock was $2.02, after a $0.12 per share impact of the costs of reacquiring the preferred stock.</p>
<p>The second quarter 1996 results included a write-off of $17.4 million, or $0.07 per share, for voluntary workforce reduction programs.</p>
<p>Company attributed $0.35 second quarter 1997 EPS, same as second quarter of 1996, to mild weather during the latest quarter.</p>
<p>Full company name is Cinergy Corp.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
